  </tr>
  <tr>
   <td colspan="4" class="content">
    
    <pre>Is this issue directly or indirectly related to the <a href="https://www.python.org/dev/peps/pep-0584/">PEP 584</a> "Add + and - operators to the built-in dict class"?
<a href="https://www.python.org/dev/peps/pep-0584/">https://www.python.org/dev/peps/pep-0584/</a></pre>
