  </tr>
  <tr>
   <td colspan="4" class="content">
    
    <pre>Yup, great plan.

On Mon, Feb 24, 2020 at 22:29 Brandt Bucher &lt;<a href="mailto:report@bugs.python.org">report@bugs.python.org</a>&gt; wrote:

&gt;
&gt; Brandt Bucher &lt;<a href="mailto:brandtbucher@gmail.com">brandtbucher@gmail.com</a>&gt; added the comment:
