   <th>Author: Guido van Rossum (gvanrossum) <span title="Contributor form received">*</span> <img src="@@file/committer.png" title="Python committer" alt="(Python committer)" /></th>
   <th>Date: 2020-02-26 20:01</th>
  </tr>
  <tr>
   <td colspan="4" class="content">
    
    <pre>
New changeset <a href="https://hg.python.org/lookup/d0ca9bd93bb9d8d4aa9bbe939ca7fd54ac870c8f">d0ca9bd93bb9d8d4aa9bbe939ca7fd54ac870c8f</a> by Brandt Bucher in branch 'master':
<a class="closed" title="[closed] Dictionary union. (PEP 584)" href="issue36144">bpo-36144</a>: Document <a href="https://www.python.org/dev/peps/pep-0584/">PEP 584</a> (<a href="https://github.com/python/cpython/pull/18659" class="closed" title="GitHub PR 18659: [merged] bpo-36144: Document PEP 584.">GH-18659</a>)
<a href="https://github.com/python/cpython/commit/d0ca9bd93bb9d8d4aa9bbe939ca7fd54ac870c8f">https://github.com/python/cpython/commit/d0ca9bd93bb9d8d4aa9bbe939ca7fd54ac870c8f</a>
</pre>
   </td>
